                                <img class="h-100 object-fit-cover w-100 mb-3 lazy-img" alt="Imigrasi Ngurah Rai Amankan 13 WNA dalam Operasi Gabungan Dugaan Prostitusi di Umalas, Seminyak, dan Canggu" data-src="/upload/2026/Foto%20Berita%20Artikel%20Siaran%20Pers/2f5a48ec-dfeb-427f-92c6-f0692e438c1c.jpeg?width=400" style="height: 200px !important;">                                <div
                                    class="badge bg-biru-muda rounded-0 small position-absolute top-0 start-0 m-2 text-uppercase">
                                    Siaran Pers                                </div>
